Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.67,0:07:54.50,Default,Ansage,0,0,0,,Batter 6, Left Field, Furuya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.76,0:08:00.45,Default,Ansage,0,0,0,,Und für den als Pinch-Hitter\Nerschienen Yui
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.62,0:08:01.21,TypePlaceholder,,0,0,0,,{\fs24\frz8.02\fax-0.18\c&HF1EAE9&\3c&H45372A&\bord2\fad(250,0)\pos(361,53)}Tōjō
